+// DOS-PORT (patch 0100, Phase 10 audio offload — instrumentation
+// scaffolding): cross-vendor extern declarations for SDL→engine
+// counter externs. The SDL-side IRQ-5 ISR (in vendor/SDL/src/audio/
+// dos/SDL_dosaudio.c per sdl-engine's slots 0037+) writes to these
